exports[`spine tone × edge type voice matrix > tone=astronomy: spine prose reads in tone voice 1`] = `
{
  "body0": "The principals are the derelict fleet cluster and Tau Reticuli Cohort; the measurable damage accumulates at Custos Echo-58 Belt VI. The boundary condition nobody can renegotiate: the safety margins were drawn before Derelict fleet cluster started moving. Longshore crews demand danger pay in scrip that clears the same day. The boundary condition nobody can renegotiate: every mitigation contract written against Refugee ark parking orbit has lapsed or failed. The principals are the refugee ark parking orbit and Custos Echo-58 Belt VI; the measurable damage accumulates at Custos Echo-58 Belt IV. Any honest error analysis ends at the same unmodeled input: every survey pass returns numbers that contradict the pass before it. Every model of the dispute shares one input: evacuation drills have gone from annual to weekly without an announcement. Three bodies define this problem: the derelict fleet cluster, Custos Echo-58 Belt IV, and Custos Echo-58 Belt IV Charter, which absorbs the perturbations. The residual no published account explains: corporate records were altered. Seismic and thermal baselines for Custos Echo-58 Belt IV are extrapolated from Custos Echo-58 Belt IV Charter's single-point coverage.",
  "spineEdgeType": "DESTABILIZES",
  "spineSummary": "Derelict fleet cluster took shape in the third pulse cycle, the perturbation from the derelict fleet cluster now exceeds Tau Reticuli Cohort's tolerance margin.",
