exports[`spine tone × edge type voice matrix > tone=balanced: spine prose reads in tone voice 1`] = `
{
  "body0": "Granite Reach Water Concession presses, Kestrel-Locke Salvage Concern holds, and Iron Compact Freight Guild pays for both: rationed air while the principals negotiate. For now it stays procedural — filings, audits, and schedules that shave each other thinner. And there is the part no one says at the negotiating table: Granite Reach Water Concession broke faith with Kestrel-Locke Salvage Concern in the bleed years. Somebody keeps updating the evacuation postings, and somebody keeps taking them down. Nobody disputes the root of it: the safety margins were drawn before Derelict fleet cluster started moving. The principals are the derelict fleet cluster and Danfeng's Flare Belt III; the casualty ledger, so far, is kept at Danfeng's Flare Belt III Cylinder. Evacuation lighters hold at ready-station through every work shift. The first-wave ghost colony presses, Danfeng's Flare Belt III holds, and Danfeng's Flare Belt III Cylinder pays for both: a supply run that arrives only when the lanes are calm. And there is the part no one says at the negotiating table: the quarantine is political. Prices quoted to the first-wave ghost colony and Danfeng's Flare Belt III differ by a margin every vendor denies. Danfeng's Flare Belt III carries Danfeng's Flare Belt III Cylinder on its surface.",
  "spineEdgeType": "CONTESTS",
  "spineSummary": "The compact between Granite Reach Water Concession and Kestrel-Locke Salvage Concern broke in the bleed years, Everything else in this system is priced against the quarrel between the two of them.",
}
`;

exports[`spine tone × edge type voice matrix > tone=cinematic: spine prose reads in tone voice 1`] = `
{
  "body0": "Two names on every manifest and every curse: Brothers of Choir, Long Knife Choir. Underneath the flags and the filings, the truth is a blade: every neutral broker who touched this dispute has since recused or vanished. The joint maintenance schedule still runs, but each side sends its own inspector to watch the other's. The war is on, whatever the bulletins call it. Carrion Synod circles Crown of Dust Pact the way debt circles a harvest. The public channel carries two incompatible traffic advisories for the same lane. Freight insurance for the contested run now costs more than the freight. The fight belongs to the resonance-pumped exocomet swarm and Calvera-10 V; the bleeding is done at Calvera-10 V Platform. It is loud now — escort guns, night transfers, and funerals with honor guards. At night the lights of Calvera-10 V Platform are the only argument that Calvera-10 V belongs to anyone.",
  "spineEdgeType": "CONTESTS",
  "spineSummary": "The compact between Brothers of Choir and Long Knife Choir broke in the silent decade, the two of them are bleeding each other dry, and the system cheers them on.",
